.TH SIGMA_DIFFERENCE 1 2000-1月 "Partitions.Creates" "Partitions.Creates"
.SH NAME
Partitions.Creates \- Create the partition data from a raw data frame: the start / stop columns
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIPartitions.Creates(\fBPartitionRaw\fR as <generic> DataFrameResolver, 
\fBTagCol\fR as string, 
\fBStartTag\fR as string, 
\fBStopTag\fR as string, 
\fBNt\fR as <generic> FastaSeq);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Create the partition data from a raw data frame: the start / stop columns
 define the segment loci on the given genome sequence.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBPartitionRaw\fB \fR\- the raw partition data frame. 
.PP
.PP
\fBTagCol\fB \fR\- the column name of the partition tag. 
.PP
.PP
\fBStartTag\fB \fR\- the column name of the segment start loci. 
.PP
.PP
\fBStopTag\fB \fR\- the column name of the segment stop loci. 
.PP
.PP
\fBNt\fB \fR\- the genome sequence. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the created partition data collection
.PP
